From: Amir Latipov <kimciwork@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:42:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat(ai-lab): skirmish AI commander for the idle army,
 tempo from scripts

Enabled per player by the script counter _AILAB_COMMANDER. Every 5 s the
commander hits enemies inside our base, otherwise attacks the nearest
enemy building whose defence is at most 0.7 of the free army, with a
minimum army value of 2000 and a 45 s breather between attacks.
Period and breather scale with the script counter _AILAB_TEMPO (percent,
set by tools/ai_tempo.py), so the bot's pace changes without a rebuild.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
